  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<p></p><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEiDEKmMi3W_TvC_7B6aJ33KAeH3jdOTf1L_RcOWMQNebbrKxH-SWz0iOiBE-llZulF05LVX1gKoM8K7echTkD31jgKE4w7l3m7DVWLdOy0KR_M8724ibJfg735HS1XeVhNEKWN831YfLRlk/s1415/9789578019287_b1.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1415\" data-original-width=\"1000\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEiDEKmMi3W_TvC_7B6aJ33KAeH3jdOTf1L_RcOWMQNebbrKxH-SWz0iOiBE-llZulF05LVX1gKoM8K7echTkD31jgKE4w7l3m7DVWLdOy0KR_M8724ibJfg735HS1XeVhNEKWN831YfLRlk/w452-h640/9789578019287_b1.jpg\" width=\"452\" /></a></div><br /><b><br /></b><p></p><p><b>作品名稱</b></p><p>唱家己ê歌</p><div><br /></div><p><b>冊ê簡介</b></p><p><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\">&nbsp;</span>ISBN：9789578019362</p><p><br /></p><p>https://reurl.cc/OXoLor</p><p><br /></p><p>台語兒童公民繪本微動畫：《唱家己的歌》、《揣自由的台灣烏熊》、《石虎的厝》（三本一套）</p><p><br /></p><p>作者：莊佳穎</p><p><br /></p><p>畫圖：薛如芸、張家嘉</p><p><br /></p><p>出版社：前衛</p><p><br /></p><p>唱家己ê歌：走揣家己ê故事。</p><p><br /></p><p>粟鳥仔發現家己ê siū內底ke一粒khah大粒ê卵，參家己生ê卵做伙pū--出-來了後，發現原來he是一隻豆仔鳥baby。豆仔鳥baby kap粟鳥仔baby ê歌聲完全無仝款，鳥仔囝起冤家，tsit聲到底如何是好？</p><p><br /></p><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div><span face=\"&quot;arial&quot; , &quot;helvetica&quot; , sans-serif\"><b>台文通訊BONG報325期，2021年4月出刊。</b></span></div><div><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEi-wJ849kd_emboSXf2YxGvTEzrEvU8dnt9eBO9comHMkkJz9ZBLsIy5mdFKBeVXsnFOPbV7T_FGLTt5x7b7YzOIip4UJV1k1HItwxjfkkozHxgMmtt-LNIHk9dvwv1p_lCTOAefB7tRA-J/s1424/325%25E5%258F%25B0%25E6%2596%2587%25E9%2580%259A%25E8%25A8%258ABONG%25E5%25A0%25B1_%25E5%25B0%2581%25E9%259D%25A2.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1424\" data-original-width=\"1000\" height=\"400\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEi-wJ849kd_emboSXf2YxGvTEzrEvU8dnt9eBO9comHMkkJz9ZBLsIy5mdFKBeVXsnFOPbV7T_FGLTt5x7b7YzOIip4UJV1k1HItwxjfkkozHxgMmtt-LNIHk9dvwv1p_lCTOAefB7tRA-J/w281-h400/325%25E5%258F%25B0%25E6%2596%2587%25E9%2580%259A%25E8%25A8%258ABONG%25E5%25A0%25B1_%25E5%25B0%2581%25E9%259D%25A2.jpg\" width=\"281\" /></a></div><br /></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div style=\"background-color: white; margin-bottom: 6px; margin-top: 6px; text-align: -webkit-center;\"><div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 15px;\"><b><br /></b></div><span style=\"color: #38761d; font-family: inherit;\"><b>歡迎捐款贊助　李江却台語文教基金會　</b></span></div><div><b><span style=\"color: #38761d; font-family: inherit;\">（捐款thang抵稅，匯款了後請通知02-23112199）</span></b></div></div><div style=\"background-color: white; margin-bottom: 6px; margin-top: 6px; text-align: -webkit-center;\"><div><span style=\"color: #38761d; font-family: inherit;\"><b>線上捐款(定期定額)&nbsp;<a data-ft=\"{&quot;tn&quot;:&quot;-U&quot;}\" data-lynx-mode=\"async\" href=\"https://l.facebook.com/l.php?u=https%3A%2F%2Fppt.cc%2FfF5bhx&amp;h=AT1fIGbvLe-H1RfIAEmaBwSoHSud2mWn8lrfo0xPDXLyCEJ6_oyPKdt-VNpBwe2ie9QCjJZfObjdC0zbQCynJ54D2Wi_b8ZrVcDWstK8-oYv8FmldyEJo_KdoHuWC05sSueoTuSvJ5cr-p_vScPimOGX4wzN4y0tm93TSYPwa_Oy3MkFQCQALsRTZFMOuwZl3PJcYWBoT4jwc6LmmvFHGmEYyMh57UFUGaQo8oSSuqcQD7MKG6wLN7MfjP3hZh1vLhHapsOOcRjYmtcIPyZgahNTgWaTFPQekTNcLnwDRhPn5DUPgyHeN0NWy-eAvWaf1orAzEnaT0bXGSBh6WL5ZAg_4sea_VdaRcccV0V-eEdDhNVVJKe0z-BljR9iJL_jWIDn2Jg-L_StZx71NBmaz7xd3VsLzNHGj2fO28pTvMz9QEOhl9nJrC80TCbPW5QlyDfD0ZK9o_8n3YOoDoX6PLV_4rNk2cvzW43qFquAkjfncrxhxCKH-VY6Kf7T3qxnHFKyq5jaEBd-Gzbx3BOuAS0L2ZAq5p4l1ciYXkt6XOQM7lnaWciPYKDMH73hsYXjsMWMXsK2AWmIxmqDhr3wrIhYsOOwJNPzsMyjmPbI9ddmSRJ_pqcuxGjmrXlJ